    SYPHA @ talk "私たちは策略と欺瞞を重んじる。敵を出し抜くことは名誉なことだ。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/BigTroubleLittleHamun/BigTroubleLH_golem.rpy:301
translate ja qst_BigTroubleLHamun_temple_dials_first_enter_b22933f0:

    # SYPHA @ talk "To see the fear in your enemies' eyes when they realize you have outplayed them before you plunge the knife."
    SYPHA @ talk "ナイフを突き刺す前に、自分が先手を打っていたと敵が気づいた時の恐怖の表情を見ること。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/BigTroubleLittleHamun/BigTroubleLH_golem.rpy:302
translate ja qst_BigTroubleLHamun_temple_dials_first_enter_d59ee97e:

